{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison life's got you in a pickle? This toolkit will allow you to modify your odds to your favour and allow you to enjoy the game's story worry-free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note: Activating any of these features will disable achievements for that save file. To re-enable achievements, start a new save or load a save from before using the toolkit.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Toolkit includes the following modifiers:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Toilet Wine Tonic:</strong> Fully restores your Stamina, Focus Points, Body, Mind, and Satiety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shiv and Let Die:</strong> Doubles the damage you deal to the enemy when fighting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Convict Conditioning:</strong> Gives you a percentage Damage Reduction when fighting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cell Block Hustle:</strong> Gives you extra base points when you roll dice. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast and Felonious:</strong> Reduces the time you take to perform actions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supermax:</strong> Whoa! Ignore all attribute limitations on your actions!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700610?t=1752806373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700610?t=1752806373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700610/c80b81098dd15a7e951080edaa71c71931fec3cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752806373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700610/c80b81098dd15a7e951080edaa71c71931fec3cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752806373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descripti